<title>USA: AT&amp;T names John Zeglis vice chairman. [CORRECTED 21:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T names John Zeglis vice chairman. [CORRECTED 21:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Thursday it named John Zeglis vice chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Zeglis, 50, will continue as AT&amp;T's general counsel and will remain responsible for corporate strategy, business development, external affairs and human resources, the company said. The assignment expands the board to 11 members from 10, AT&amp;T said.</p>
<p>(AT&amp;T corrects adjustment to board composition).</p>
<p>Zeglis joined AT&amp;T in 1984 from the Chicago law firm of Sidley &amp; Austin, where he was a partner.</p>
